Package: tsrm
Type: Package
Title: Estimation of Triadic and Dyadic Social Relations Model Parameters
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-05-11
Author: Steffen Nestler 
Maintainer: Steffen Nestler <steffen.nestler@uni-muenster.de>
